+++ b/moldea/runtimes/custom.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom order-triage runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` receives a runtime-owned asynchronous instruction loader, requests `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`, and assigns the resolved content to the returned agent's `instruction` field. The factory returns the `order-triage` ID with `action` set to `classify-for-human-review` and `canApproveRefunds` set to `false`.
+
+The repository does not define the injected loader's implementation or any model provider or tools.
